{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Bringing iniquity to remembrance.</b> Other meal-offerings come to atone for iniquity — a sin-offering meal-offering and a freewill meal-offering — and oil and frankincense are placed in them so that the offering may go up and rise as a sweet savor. But this one, which does not come to mention merit but to roll up iniquity — therefore her offering should not be adorned."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:58.127174515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}